    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1274690/extras/cf2dece1c68fda67ab7ad80df8e5b574.poster.avif?t=1608737365\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1274690/extras/cf2dece1c68fda67ab7ad80df8e5b574.webm?t=1608737365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1274690/extras/cf2dece1c68fda67ab7ad80df8e5b574.mp4?t=1608737365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SUMMARY</h2><br>This is an Interactive Adventure and Short Visual Novel Game depicting life on a lunar base.<br>All texts are performed by Japanese Voice Actors.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">STORY</h2><br>On a wall-mounted electronic calendar&quot;IMPORTANT!&quot; is flickering.<br> (what's my plan today?) I think vaguely.<br>The thinking like a Gaussian blur,I saw someone in sight.<br><br><i>&quot;Good Morning, Breakfast is Ready.&quot;<br>&quot;Morning, Rick\u2026 What's today\u2026?&quot;<br>&quot;Today is Christmas Eve.&quot;</i><br><br>The date shown on the calendar is December 24.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">VOICE ACTORS</h2><br>Female protagonist : Mitsu <br>Male  protagonist : Tisa <br>Rick : Hiyoko Asakura<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Player's impressions of the Japanese language version</h2><br>- The Illustration was cute and relaxed.<br>- It was like turning the pages of a picture book and I was thrilled.<br>- I had a sudden craving for an fried egg.<br><br>- It's like listening to a read-aloud.<br>- A relaxed tone. I want you to thoroughly enjoy the world of the story.<br>- The soft and soothing voice of the main character and the atmosphere of the game really fit together, and I was immersed in it.<br><br>- I want to play it again after I see the conclusion of the ending.<br>- It's a sad, refreshing, indescribable feeling.<br>- A short but profound work.It made me want to reflect on the problems of modern society.",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1274690/extras/cf2dece1c68fda67ab7ad80df8e5b574.poster.avif?t=1608737365\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1274690/extras/cf2dece1c68fda67ab7ad80df8e5b574.webm?t=1608737365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1274690/extras/cf2dece1c68fda67ab7ad80df8e5b574.mp4?t=1608737365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SUMMARY</h2><br>This is an Interactive Adventure and Short Visual Novel Game depicting life on a lunar base.<br>All texts are performed by Japanese Voice Actors.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">STORY</h2><br>On a wall-mounted electronic calendar&quot;IMPORTANT!&quot; is flickering.<br> (what's my plan today?) I think vaguely.<br>The thinking like a Gaussian blur,I saw someone in sight.<br><br><i>&quot;Good Morning, Breakfast is Ready.&quot;<br>&quot;Morning, Rick\u2026 What's today\u2026?&quot;<br>&quot;Today is Christmas Eve.&quot;</i><br><br>The date shown on the calendar is December 24.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">VOICE ACTORS</h2><br>Female protagonist : Mitsu <br>Male  protagonist : Tisa <br>Rick : Hiyoko Asakura<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Player's impressions of the Japanese language version</h2><br>- The Illustration was cute and relaxed.<br>- It was like turning the pages of a picture book and I was thrilled.<br>- I had a sudden craving for an fried egg.<br><br>- It's like listening to a read-aloud.<br>- A relaxed tone. I want you to thoroughly enjoy the world of the story.<br>- The soft and soothing voice of the main character and the atmosphere of the game really fit together, and I was immersed in it.<br><br>- I want to play it again after I see the conclusion of the ending.<br>- It's a sad, refreshing, indescribable feeling.<br>- A short but profound work.It made me want to reflect on the problems of modern society.",
